{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-lifecycle-state-mapping-consistency","title":"跨 PSP 支付状态机映射与生命周期一致性对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/payment-orchestration-psp-abstraction-model/payment-lifecycle-state-mapping-consistency","wordCount":2320,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨-psp-支付状态机映射与生命周期一致性对账\">跨 PSP 支付状态机映射与生命周期一致性对账</h1><p>当一个跨境电商收银台同时接了 Stripe、Adyen、Checkout.com 和本地收单行时，同一笔订单在不同 PSP 的账本里会以<strong>完全不同的状态词汇</strong>存在。Stripe 说 <code>requires_capture</code>，Adyen 说 <code>Authorised</code>，ISO 20022 的银行通道说 <code>ACTC</code>，而你的订单系统需要知道的是：「这笔钱现在能不能发货」。状态机映射要解决的正是这个翻译问题；生命周期一致性对账要解决的是翻译之后仍然存在的分歧——webhook 乱序、丢失、重复，以及 PSP 侧单方面改状态造成的账实不符。</p>\n<p>本文聚焦收单抽象层中的<strong>状态域建模与对账</strong>，路由权重与故障切换策略属于兄弟章节 <a href=\"../smart-routing-failover-optimization/\">智能路由与故障切换</a> 的边界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>收单抽象层的本质是把多个 PSP 各自的<strong>私有状态机</strong>投影到一个<strong>统一域状态机</strong>上。PSP 的状态是对它自己账本的描述，而统一域状态是对「这笔交易在资金与履约意义上处于什么阶段」的描述，两者不是同构的：一个 PSP 可能用 7 个状态表达另一个 PSP 用 3 个状态表达的东西。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[created&lt;br/&gt;已创建意图] --&gt; B[requires_action&lt;br/&gt;待顾客认证]&#10;  B --&gt; C[authorized&lt;br/&gt;已授权未请款]&#10;  A --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[captured&lt;br/&gt;已请款]&#10;  C --&gt; E[cancelled&lt;br/&gt;已撤销]&#10;  B --&gt; F[failed&lt;br/&gt;授权失败]&#10;  D --&gt; G[refunded&lt;br/&gt;已退款]&#10;  D --&gt; H[disputed&lt;br/&gt;争议/拒付]&#10;  C --&gt; I[expired&lt;br/&gt;授权过期]&#10;  I --&gt; F&#10;  D --&gt; J[settled&lt;br/&gt;已结算入账]\">graph TD\n  A[created&lt;br/&gt;已创建意图] --&gt; B[requires_action&lt;br/&gt;待顾客认证]\n  B --&gt; C[authorized&lt;br/&gt;已授权未请款]\n  A --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[captured&lt;br/&gt;已请款]\n  C --&gt; E[cancelled&lt;br/&gt;已撤销]\n  B --&gt; F[failed&lt;br/&gt;授权失败]\n  D --&gt; G[refunded&lt;br/&gt;已退款]\n  D --&gt; H[disputed&lt;br/&gt;争议/拒付]\n  C --&gt; I[expired&lt;br/&gt;授权过期]\n  I --&gt; F\n  D --&gt; J[settled&lt;br/&gt;已结算入账]</pre><p>关键设计决策是：<strong>统一域状态必须是偏序集（lattice），而不是线性枚举</strong>。因为授权过期的 <code>expired</code> 和撤销的 <code>cancelled</code> 在业务上不可比较，而 <code>captured</code> 又严格晚于 <code>authorized</code>。用线性枚举会在乱序 webhook 到达时被迫「回退」状态，而回退是支付系统里最危险的操作——它会让已经发货的订单重新变成未支付。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>PSP 私有状态机</th>\n<th>统一域状态机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>描述对象</td>\n<td>该 PSP 内部账本的事实</td>\n<td>资金 + 履约的业务阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态数量</td>\n<td>7–20 个（含技术态）</td>\n<td>9–11 个（业务态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>允许回退</td>\n<td>是（如重试导致回 <code>requires_payment_method</code>）</td>\n<td><strong>否</strong>（单调递增）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与结算的关系</td>\n<td>内嵌（<code>settled</code> 是 PSP 状态）</td>\n<td>外置（结算属对账域，非支付域）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变更来源</td>\n<td>API 响应 + webhook</td>\n<td>仅由状态投影函数产生</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"psp-原生状态到统一域的映射表\">PSP 原生状态到统一域的映射表</h2><p>映射不是字符串替换，而是<strong>语义等价</strong>判定。下表给出主流 PSP 的实测映射（依据 Stripe PaymentIntent lifecycle 与 Adyen Checkout v71 的 <code>resultCode</code> / webhook <code>eventCode</code> 定义）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>统一域状态</th>\n<th>Stripe（PaymentIntent <code>status</code>）</th>\n<th>Adyen（<code>resultCode</code> / 事件码）</th>\n<th>ISO 20022 外部状态码</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>created</code></td>\n<td><code>requires_payment_method</code></td>\n<td>无同步态（<code>Received</code>）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requires_action</code></td>\n<td><code>requires_action</code></td>\n<td><code>RedirectShopper</code> + <code>action</code> 对象</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>authorized</code></td>\n<td><code>requires_capture</code></td>\n<td><code>Authorised</code>（<code>AUTHORISATION</code>）</td>\n<td><code>ACCP</code> / <code>ACTC</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>processing</code></td>\n<td><code>processing</code></td>\n<td><code>Pending</code> / <code>Received</code></td>\n<td><code>PDNG</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>captured</code></td>\n<td><code>succeeded</code>（已请款）</td>\n<td><code>CAPTURE</code> 事件</td>\n<td><code>ACSC</code> / <code>ACSP</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cancelled</code></td>\n<td><code>canceled</code></td>\n<td><code>CANCELLATION</code> / <code>TECHNICAL_CANCEL</code></td>\n<td><code>CANC</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>failed</code></td>\n<td>失败后回退到 <code>requires_payment_method</code></td>\n<td><code>Refused</code> / <code>Error</code>（<code>AUTHORISATION</code> 中 <code>success:false</code>）</td>\n<td><code>RJCT</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>expired</code></td>\n<td>授权超时</td>\n<td><code>EXPIRE</code> 事件</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>refunded</code></td>\n<td>Refunds API（<code>charge.refunded</code>）</td>\n<td><code>REFUND</code> / <code>REFUND_WITH_DATA</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>disputed</code></td>\n<td><code>charge.dispute.created</code></td>\n<td><code>CHARGEBACK</code> / <code>NOTIFICATION_OF_CHARGEBACK</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个必须注意的映射陷阱：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Stripe 的失败不是终态。</strong> 授权被拒后 PaymentIntent 回到 <code>requires_payment_method</code>，这意味着「失败」和「待支付」共享同一个 <code>status</code> 值，仅靠 <code>status</code> 无法区分。必须结合 <code>last_payment_error</code> 字段判定，否则重试逻辑会把一笔真实失败误判为顾客尚未提交。</li>\n<li><strong>Adyen 的 <code>Received</code> 不是授权成功。</strong> 它表示请求已受理但结果未定，业务上等价于 <code>processing</code>，绝不能映射为 <code>authorized</code>——这是「未授权即发货」类资损事故的常见来源。</li>\n<li><strong>ISO 20022 的 <code>ACSC</code> 与卡组织的 <code>captured</code> 语义不同。</strong> <code>ACSC</code>（AcceptedSettlementCompleted）描述的是清算层结果，而卡组织的 capture 是请款动作；在很多跨境场景里请款当天并不会得到 <code>ACSC</code>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>映射代码必须把「无法识别的原始状态」处理为<strong>显式的未知态并告警</strong>，而不是 <code>default</code> 到一个猜测值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type UnifiedState =&#10;  | &#39;created&#39;&#10;  | &#39;requires_action&#39;&#10;  | &#39;authorized&#39;&#10;  | &#39;processing&#39;&#10;  | &#39;captured&#39;&#10;  | &#39;cancelled&#39;&#10;  | &#39;failed&#39;&#10;  | &#39;expired&#39;&#10;  | &#39;refunded&#39;&#10;  | &#39;disputed&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ProjectionResult {&#10;  state: UnifiedState | &#39;unknown&#39;;&#10;  reason?: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function projectStripe(intent: { status: string; last_payment_error?: unknown }): ProjectionResult {&#10;  switch (intent.status) {&#10;    case &#39;requires_payment_method&#39;:&#10;      return intent.last_payment_error&#10;        ? { state: &#39;failed&#39;, reason: &#39;requires_payment_method_with_error&#39; }&#10;        : { state: &#39;created&#39; };&#10;    case &#39;requires_capture&#39;:&#10;      return { state: &#39;authorized&#39; };&#10;    case &#39;processing&#39;:&#10;      return { state: &#39;processing&#39; };&#10;    case &#39;succeeded&#39;:&#10;      return { state: &#39;captured&#39; };&#10;    case &#39;canceled&#39;:&#10;      return { state: &#39;cancelled&#39; };&#10;    case &#39;requires_action&#39;:&#10;      return { state: &#39;requires_action&#39; };&#10;    default:&#10;      return { state: &#39;unknown&#39;, reason: `unmapped_status:${intent.status}` };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnifiedState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'created'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'requires_action'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'authorized'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'processing'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'captured'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cancelled'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'failed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expired'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refunded'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'disputed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProjectionResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnifiedState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  reason</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> projectStripe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">intent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">last_payment_error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProjectionResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (intent.status) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'requires_payment_method'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intent.last_payment_error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'requires_payment_method_with_error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'created'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'requires_capture'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'authorized'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'processing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'processing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'succeeded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'captured'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'canceled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    case</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'requires_action'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'requires_action'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { state: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`unmapped_status:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intent</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"幂等键与乱序-webhook-的状态投影\">幂等键与乱序 Webhook 的状态投影</h2><p>跨境场景里 webhook 的到达顺序<strong>不保证</strong>与事件发生顺序一致。Stripe 与 Adyen 都可能在网络重试下重复投递同一事件，Adyen 明确要求接收方先返回 2xx 再异步处理，且提供 <code>originalReference</code> 用于把后续事件（capture/refund）关联回初始授权。因此状态更新必须满足两个性质：</p>\n<p><strong>交换性（commutativity）</strong>：对同一交易的事件集合，任意处理顺序得到相同终态。用偏序集上的上确界（join）实现：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>⊔</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{t+1} = s_t \\sqcup f(e_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(e_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是事件投影出的候选状态，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊔</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqcup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊔</span></span></span></span></span> 是域状态格上的最小上界。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(e_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不可比较时（例如先收到 refund 再收到 capture），不覆盖，而是标记 <code>out_of_order</code> 并写入待调和队列。</p>\n<p><strong>幂等性（idempotency）</strong>：同一事件重复投递不改变终态。实现上以 <code>(psp, psp_reference, event_code, occurred_at)</code> 构造事件指纹，落库时对指纹建唯一约束。Stripe 侧的出站调用则用 <code>Idempotency-Key</code> 头——Stripe 会缓存首个请求的状态码与响应体，键长上限 255 字符，且约 24 小时后被清理，这意味着<strong>依靠幂等键做长期去重是不可靠的</strong>，长期去重必须落在自己的事件指纹表上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant PSP&#10;  participant WH as Webhook 入口&#10;  participant Q as 待处理队列&#10;  participant SM as 状态投影器&#10;  participant DB as 交易状态表&#10;  PSP-&gt;&gt;WH: CAPTURE 事件&#10;  PSP-&gt;&gt;WH: AUTHORISATION 事件(延迟重投)&#10;  WH-&gt;&gt;Q: 立即返回 2xx 并入队&#10;  Q-&gt;&gt;SM: 取出 AUTHORISATION&#10;  SM-&gt;&gt;DB: authorized(cas: version)&#10;  Q-&gt;&gt;SM: 取出 CAPTURE&#10;  SM-&gt;&gt;DB: captured(单调 join)&#10;  Note over SM,DB: 若顺序反转,join 保证终态相同\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant PSP\n  participant WH as Webhook 入口\n  participant Q as 待处理队列\n  participant SM as 状态投影器\n  participant DB as 交易状态表\n  PSP-&gt;&gt;WH: CAPTURE 事件\n  PSP-&gt;&gt;WH: AUTHORISATION 事件(延迟重投)\n  WH-&gt;&gt;Q: 立即返回 2xx 并入队\n  Q-&gt;&gt;SM: 取出 AUTHORISATION\n  SM-&gt;&gt;DB: authorized(cas: version)\n  Q-&gt;&gt;SM: 取出 CAPTURE\n  SM-&gt;&gt;DB: captured(单调 join)\n  Note over SM,DB: 若顺序反转,join 保证终态相同</pre><h2 id=\"终局性与对账一致性\">终局性与对账一致性</h2><p>「终局」（terminal）的判定决定了对账频率与人工介入阈值。不是所有非成功状态都终局：<code>authorized</code> 会在卡组织授权有效期后过期（信用卡授权冻结通常可长达 30 天，借记卡约 1–8 个工作日，具体由发卡行决定，见 Wikipedia「Authorization hold」条目），而 <code>processing</code> 在异步支付方式下可能持续数日。</p>\n<p>一致性对账的核心指标是<strong>状态漂移率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>drift</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>psp</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{drift} = \\frac{|\\{t \\in T : s_{\\text{local}}(t) \\neq \\pi(s_{\\text{psp}}(t))\\}|}{|T|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">drift</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">psp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">))}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span> 是本文定义的投影函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是对账窗口内的交易集合。工程上把漂移拆成三类，处理策略完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漂移类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>迟到事件</td>\n<td>本地早于 PSP 的最终态</td>\n<td>等待窗口内自然收敛，超窗告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丢失事件</td>\n<td>本地长期落后于 PSP</td>\n<td>主动拉取 PSP 状态（<code>GET /payments</code>）补偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义冲突</td>\n<td>本地与 PSP 在同一维度给出矛盾事实</td>\n<td><strong>必须人工介入</strong>，禁止自动覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未知状态</td>\n<td>投影返回 <code>unknown</code></td>\n<td>冻结该交易的资金动作 + 即时告警</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>调和作业（reconciliation job）的正确形态是<strong>只向前推进、带回执</strong>：它从 PSP 拉取权威状态，调用同一个投影函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span></span></span></span></span>，再以乐观并发（版本号 CAS）写回；若写回时版本已变，则丢弃本次结果重读，而不是强制覆盖。这样即使调和作业与 webhook 处理器并发运行，也不会互相覆盖。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的约束是：<strong>对账不能修复资金事实</strong>。如果 PSP 侧显示已 capture 而本地显示 authorized，调和能纠正的是状态字段；但如果系统已经基于错误状态做了退款或二次请款，那属于资金异常，必须走独立的差错处理流程，不能靠改状态字段掩盖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态收敛算法与落地要点\">状态收敛算法与落地要点</h2><p>把上述性质收敛成一个可执行的投影器，其契约如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>单调</strong>：新状态在偏序上不得低于旧状态，除非触发条件属于显式允许的回退白名单（如「授权过期」从 <code>authorized</code> → <code>expired</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等</strong>：相同事件指纹重复投递，投影结果与版本号均不变。</li>\n<li><strong>可审计</strong>：每次状态变更记录 <code>(before, after, event_fingerprint, projector_version)</code>，投影函数本身要版本化——映射表变更后必须能回放历史事件验证结果一致。</li>\n<li><strong>有边界</strong>：投影器不发起任何 PSP 调用，也不做资金动作，它只是纯函数；拉取补偿由外层的调和作业负责。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>KaTeX 之外，投影器与调和作业的分工可以用一个简单的成本权衡判断。设 webhook 覆盖率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，调和周期为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>，则平均状态滞后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L \\approx (1-c)\\cdot \\Delta / 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ/2</span></span></span></span></span>。跨境实时发货场景通常要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 在分钟级，此时若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0.95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 需压到 30 分钟以内；而结算对账可以容忍 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为天级，因为结算走的是 PSP 的文件报送（settlement report）而非事件流。</p>\n<p>最后，跨 PSP 的映射表应当<strong>集中维护、单一真相源</strong>：把每个 PSP 的原始状态到统一域的映射及已知陷阱写在一份可测试的配置里，而非散落在各 webhook 处理器中，并用真实历史样本做回归。当 PSP 升级 API 版本（如 Adyen Checkout v70→v71）时，只需更新配置并重放样本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>统一域状态必须是<strong>偏序格</strong>而非线性枚举，状态更新用 join（最小上界）实现单调、可交换、幂等。</li>\n<li>映射是语义等价判定而非字符串替换；三个高频陷阱是 Stripe 失败复用 <code>requires_payment_method</code>、Adyen <code>Received</code> 不等于授权、ISO 20022 <code>ACSC</code> 属于清算层语义。</li>\n<li>未知原始状态必须显式落到 <code>unknown</code> 并告警，禁止 <code>default</code> 猜测。</li>\n<li>长期去重靠自己的事件指纹表，不能依赖 PSP 幂等键（Stripe 约 24 小时清理）。</li>\n<li>对账用<strong>只向前推进、带回执、乐观并发</strong>的调和作业，且只修正状态、不修正资金事实。</li>\n<li>映射表集中维护并可回放，投影函数版本化，是跨 PSP 长周期可维护的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>主要来源：Stripe PaymentIntent lifecycle 与 verifying-status 文档（docs.stripe.com）、Stripe Idempotent requests 文档、Adyen Checkout API v71 与 Webhooks 文档（docs.adyen.com）、ISO 20022 外部状态码集（iso20022.org）、EMVCo EMV 3-D Secure / PSD2 SCA（en.wikipedia.org）、Authorization hold 时序（en.wikipedia.org）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨 PSP 支付状态机映射与生命周期一致性对账","id":"跨-psp-支付状态机映射与生命周期一致性对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PSP 原生状态到统一域的映射表","id":"psp-原生状态到统一域的映射表"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等键与乱序 Webhook 的状态投影","id":"幂等键与乱序-webhook-的状态投影"},{"level":2,"text":"终局性与对账一致性","id":"终局性与对账一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"状态收敛算法与落地要点","id":"状态收敛算法与落地要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"统一支付 API 与适配器防腐层：跨 PSP 字段、币种与状态机翻译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/payment-orchestration-psp-abstraction-model/unified-payment-api-adapter-anticorruption"},"next":{"title":"路由规则引擎与策略模型：成本、授权率、卡组织与地域决策因子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/smart-routing-failover-optimization/routing-rule-engine-strategy-model"}}